---
title: "Event Storming: Аномалия обнаружена во время мониторинга"
---
flowchart TD
    subgraph STREAMING[Streaming Domain]
        PROC[Telemetry Processing Context]
        ALERT[Anomaly Detection Context]
    end

    subgraph MEDICINE[Medicine Domain]
        REC[Medical Records Context]
        EMERG[Emergency Context]
    end

    subgraph CLINIC[Clinic Domain]
        NOTIF[Notification Context]
        VISIT[Patient Visit Context]
    end

    PROC -->|TelemetryReceived| ALERT
    ALERT -->|AnomalyDetected| ALERT

    ALERT -.->|AnomalyDetected| REC
    ALERT -.->|AnomalyDetected| EMERG
    ALERT -.->|AnomalyDetected| NOTIF

    NOTIF -->|NotifyDoctor| VISIT